sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    rect rgb(224, 242, 254)
    note over ExternalGateway, WebhookAction: Provedor Externo & HTTP Endpoint
    participant ExternalGateway as Gateway Externo (Mercado Pago / PIX API)
    participant WebhookAction as Slim 4 Route Handler (PaymentWebhookAction)
    end
    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
    note over Factory, OrderRepo: Camada de Negócio & Padrões GoF (Factory + Adapter)
    participant Factory as PaymentGatewayFactory
    participant Adapter as MercadoPagoAdapter / PixGateway (PaymentGatewayInterface)
    participant OrderRepo as OrderRepository
    end
    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
    note over Observers, DB: Subssistema de Observers & Persistência
    participant Observers as OrderEmailObserver / StockObserver (OrderObserverInterface)
    participant DB as MySQL Database (tbkk_order & tbkk_order_history)
    end
    note over ExternalGateway, DB: 1. Recebimento da Notificação Assíncrona e Resolução Dinâmica do Gateway
    ExternalGateway ->> WebhookAction: HTTP POST /payment/webhook/mercadopago<br/>[Header Signature + Payload JSON {id, status, order_id}]
    activate ExternalGateway
    activate WebhookAction
    WebhookAction ->> WebhookAction: Valida assinatura de segurança (X-Signature)
    WebhookAction ->> Factory: make('mercadopago')
    activate Factory
    Factory ->> Factory: Resolve 'MercadoPagoAdapter' via Container PSR-11
    Factory -->> WebhookAction: Retorna PaymentGatewayInterface (MercadoPagoAdapter)
    deactivate Factory
    note over ExternalGateway, DB: 2. Tradução do Payload Externo para Contrato Interno (Adapter)
    WebhookAction ->> Adapter: processWebhook(requestPayload)
    activate Adapter
    Adapter ->> ExternalGateway: GET /v1/payments/{payment_id} (Verificação de Autenticidade)
    activate ExternalGateway
    ExternalGateway -->> Adapter: Payment Status: "approved", PaidAmount: R$ 250.00
    deactivate ExternalGateway
    Adapter ->> Adapter: Normaliza resposta para PaymentResult(status: PAID, transactionId: "MP-98765")
    Adapter -->> WebhookAction: Retorna PaymentResult
    deactivate Adapter
    note over ExternalGateway, DB: 3. Transição de Estado da Ordem & Execução de Observers Pós-Persistência
    alt PaymentResult == PAID (Pagamento Confirmado)
    WebhookAction ->> OrderRepo: updateOrderStatus(orderId, STATUS_PAYMENT_CONFIRMED)
    activate OrderRepo
    OrderRepo ->> DB: START TRANSACTION#59;<br/>UPDATE tbkk_order SET order_status_id = 2#59;<br/>INSERT INTO tbkk_order_history...#59;<br/>COMMIT#59;
    activate DB
    DB -->> OrderRepo: Transação Confirmada
    deactivate DB
    note over OrderRepo, Observers: **Desacoplamento via Eventos (Observer Pattern):**<br/>O OrderRepository notifica todos os observadores cadastrados sem acoplamento direto.
    OrderRepo ->> Observers: notify(OrderAggregate)
    activate Observers
    Observers ->> Observers: 1. OrderEmailObserver: Envia e-mail de confirmação ao cliente<br/>2. StockDeductionObserver: Confirma reserva de estoque no MySQL
    Observers -->> OrderRepo: Processamento concluído
    deactivate Observers
    OrderRepo -->> WebhookAction: Status Atualizado com Sucesso
    deactivate OrderRepo
    WebhookAction -->> ExternalGateway: HTTP 200 OK {"status": "success", "message": "Notification processed"}
    else PaymentResult == REJECTED / CANCELLED (Pagamento Recusado)
    WebhookAction ->> OrderRepo: updateOrderStatus(orderId, STATUS_CANCELED)
    activate OrderRepo
    OrderRepo ->> DB: UPDATE tbkk_order SET order_status_id = 7 (Canceled)#59;
    activate DB
    DB -->> OrderRepo: Atualizado
    deactivate DB
    OrderRepo -->> WebhookAction: Pedido Cancelado
    deactivate OrderRepo
    WebhookAction -->> ExternalGateway: HTTP 200 OK {"status": "processed", "result": "cancelled"}
    end
    deactivate WebhookAction
    deactivate ExternalGateway
